\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1. \cf0  O, face of Jesus, sore afflicted,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Ever engraved within my soul
\par Each day and hour may His atonement
\par Help me to reach the cherished goal.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj I offer thanks to Him who saved me;
\par His precious blood for me was shed.
\par He freed this poor and wretched sinner
\par And gave eternal life instead!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Thou, Lord, who bled for our transgressions
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj For us a shameful death has died;
\par Grant mercy, hear our soul's confessions
\par Free us from death's dark pow'r and might.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Now opened is a fount of mercy;
\par A stream of life so pure and clear,
\par Source of eternal love, flow freely,
\par Fill Thou our hearts, dispel all fear.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Lord Jesus, for Thy pain and suffering,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj   I promise to be at Thy side
\par Thy life, Thy image here receiving,
\par In all Thy precepts would abide.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou chose the path which led to Calvary,
\par Which made me still my sad lament.
\par Now I resolve to love more dearly;
\par \pard     This pleases Thee, I'm confident.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

